@startuml
 title Data flow — Quality credentials and source identity
 rectangle "GitHub HTTPS API and public source" as GitHub
 rectangle "Owner-only local credential files" as Credentials
 rectangle "Fixed collector" as Collector
 rectangle "Disposable scanner" as Scanner
 rectangle "Local SonarQube" as Sonar
 database "Private collector state" as State
 GitHub --> Collector : source and LCOV\nPII: Git author names/emails and actor metadata
 Credentials --> Collector : sensitive: repository-scoped token\nand project analysis token
 Collector --> Scanner : read-only source and validated LCOV\nPII: Git author names/emails\nsensitive: project token in environment
 Scanner --> Sonar : source findings and SCM identity\nPII: Git author names/emails\nsensitive: project token on approved local HTTP segment
 Collector --> GitHub : HTTPS exact-SHA status\nsensitive: scoped GitHub authentication
 Collector --> State : run/attempt/SHA and gate identity\nno actor profile or credential values
 note bottom of State
Private directory and redacted diagnostics
Credentials outside checkout and artifacts
end note
@enduml
